// Ghosty Pro LEADS pack (40 sounds): { category, name, FX scene, spec }, same grammar as ProBankData.inc / ProTrapPresets.inc plus the
// MACROS (ProMacros.h):  mc=lead|pluck|stack|aggr  a macro template (4 named knobs: BRIGHTNESS, WIDTH, MOVEMENT, SIZE),
//                        mc1:cutoff=.3  adds / replaces one target of macro 1 (amount, optional ^curve),  mc1=NAME~ renames (~ = bipolar).
// Every lead keeps two matrix slots for the MOVEMENT knob: slot 1 = LFO 2 > cutoff, slot 2 = LFO 2 > osc 1 position, both at 0 until the
// knob moves (LFO 2 free-running at 0.25 Hz; MOVEMENT also speeds it up). BRIGHTNESS and WIDTH are bipolar: mac1=.5 mac2=.5 is the
// preset as designed, SIZE at 0 is the preset, SIZE at 1 the build-up (brighter, wider, more space, more sub, layers up).
// Every lead keeps the Ghost FX reverb at least slightly on (verb >= .02): switching it on changes the dry level, so a SIZE move must never
// cross verb = 0.01. Principle: simple clean big sounds; the melody is the magic. Nothing here names an artist, a product or a brand.

